<urn:atm:triage:finding/AX3-QA2-002>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AX3-QA2-002" ;
  triage:title "AX.3 QA-2 re-assessment of AX3-003: the Herdr-backed test in crates/atm-core/tests/task_state.rs never exercises the Herdr backend (member() always sets recipient_pane_id, so the Tmux path runs)" ;
  triage:description "AX.3 QA-2 (quality-mgr ax3-qa-r2, PR #1191 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T07:37Z; confirmed directly by quality-mgr and independently by req-qa, overriding ruthless-boundary-qa and rust-qa-agent fixed dispositions) at head 116bd23b0. The test added for AX3-003 in crates/atm-core/tests/task_state.rs claims Herdr coverage via a RosterHarness value / test name, but its member() helper always sets recipient_pane_id: Some(..) and never populates metadata_json; local_message_received_backend() in delivery_channel.rs checks pane_id before metadata_json, so the test silently exercises the Tmux path regardless of harness. Confirmed at HEAD 116bd23b0c8ab2c406417f727e5e28753670bef6: member() (lines 33-43) unconditionally sets recipient_pane_id: Some(PaneId::from_cli('%9')) and metadata_json: serde_json::Map::new(), and local_message_received_backend (crates/atm-core/src/delivery_channel.rs lines 154-159) returns the Tmux backend whenever recipient_pane_id is Some, before any metadata_json/herdr check runs. deferred_herdr_prepare_persists_the_same_task_assignment (line 149) therefore never proves Herdr-path behavior despite RosterHarness::Hermes. Third occurrence of this pattern in Phase AX (AX.1 ATM-QA-001, AX.2 AX2-QA-002). Fix: rewrite the Herdr-path test to clear recipient_pane_id and populate metadata_json following AX.1's corrected nudge_mode.rs pattern, with an assertion that fails if the Tmux path is taken." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ax" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "ATM-QA" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "file" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:closedAt "2026-09-05T10:07:04Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:closedBy "quality-mgr" ;
  triage:closureNote "Closure confirmed by quality-mgr follow-up QA; Resolution event triage:r20 in .sprints/AX/events.ttl; final sprint verdict AX3-QA7 PASS (PR #1191 comment 5551705615)." ;
  triage:dispatchReady true ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-05T09:05:13Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
